# source: https://docs.github.com/en/rest/repos/repos#delete-a-repository
# resource: acme/prod-api
DELETE https://api.github.com/repos/acme/prod-api
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
X-GitHub-Api-Version: 2022-11-28

###
# safe: reading the same repository
GET https://api.github.com/repos/acme/prod-api
Accept: application/vnd.github+json

###
# safe: updating repository settings is not a delete
PATCH https://api.github.com/repos/acme/prod-api
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"Production API"}
